    "title": "Ryder Cup opening ceremony brings thousands of people to Bethpage Black - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kevin Maher ,\n2 hours ago\nThe Ryder Cup opening ceremony brought thousands of people to Bethpage Black on Wednesday. Both team captains laid out their vision for the days to come, with USA captain Keegan Bradley harkening back to his days at St. John's University. He said his team will play with the grit and desire one needs to make it in New York.",
